/><line x1=\"455\" y1=\"225\" x2=\"495\" y2=\"218\" stroke=\"#C62828\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"110\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1A237E\">Each layer builds on previous</text><line x1=\"230\" y1=\"115\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"320\" stroke=\"#1A237E\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#aCap)\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"160\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#616161\">Text understanding</text><text x=\"215\" y=\"200\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#616161\">Image recognition</text><text x=\"215\" y=\"240\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#616161\">Complex logic</text><text x=\"215\" y=\"280\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#616161\">Tool use &amp; APIs</text><text x=\"215\" y=\"320\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#616161\">Self-directed goals</text><defs><marker id=\"aCap\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><polygon points=\"0 0, 10 3.5, 0 7\" fill=\"#1A237E\"/></marker></defs></svg></div><h3>Step-by-Step: Deploying Autonomous Agents</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Define agent roles and tasks.</li>\n<li>Use frameworks like LangChain or LlamaIndex.</li>\n<li>Integrate with APIs and data sources.</li>\n<li>Monitor and optimize agent collaboration.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h3>Extra Resources</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href='https://www.nature.com/collections/ai' target='_blank'>Nature: AI Research</a></li>\n<li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/@TwoMinutePapers' target='_blank'>Two Minute Papers (YouTube)</a></li>\n<li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/@YannicKilcher' target='_blank'>Yannic Kilcher (YouTube)</a></li>\n</ul>",
